<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encountering, falling into</i>
			the earth's shadow, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= foreg., <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.144
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				6.14
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ περιπτώσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>experience</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυγκαταινέω . . τὸν
				λογισμόν, ἤνπερ ἐκ περιπτώσιος</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιέηται τὴν ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Praec.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε πεῖρα οὔτε π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.918c
			</span></i>tit. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλογος τριβὴ καὶ
			π</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				44o
			</span></i>a ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ περίπτωσιν ἐγνωσμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.29
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.164S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Oen.
				10
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
